584
00:38:23.000 --> 00:38:25.400
[music intensifies]

585
00:38:39.120 --> 00:38:41.120
[tense music builds]

586
00:38:43.360 --> 00:38:44.480
[music fades]

587
00:38:44.560 --> 00:38:46.280
I was worried about you. What happened?

588
00:38:47.320 --> 00:38:49.320
Uh, I'm fine. It's okay.

589
00:38:49.400 --> 00:38:51.560
What did that officer want?
What did he say?

590
00:38:51.640 --> 00:38:53.240
Nothing.

591
00:38:53.320 --> 00:38:54.520
What do you mean, "nothing?"

592
00:38:54.600 --> 00:38:56.640
What were you
talking about this whole time?

593
00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:01.120
Beyza, go inside, please.

594
00:39:01.760 --> 00:39:03.600
I need you to tell me the truth, come on.

595
00:39:03.680 --> 00:39:04.960
Beyza, go inside.

596
00:39:07.040 --> 00:39:08.040
Come on.

597
00:39:08.720 --> 00:39:09.720
Go on.

598
00:39:09.760 --> 00:39:13.200
[melancholy orchestral music playing]

599
00:39:28.640 --> 00:39:30.400
[music fades]

600
00:39:30.480 --> 00:39:32.920
[steady ticking]

601
00:39:43.400 --> 00:39:45.400
[clicking slows]

602
00:39:56.400 --> 00:39:57.880
[clicking fades]

603
00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:15.880
[panting]

604
00:40:15.960 --> 00:40:16.840
[sniffs]

605
00:40:16.920 --> 00:40:18.920
[birds calling]

606
00:40:40.480 --> 00:40:41.560
